{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"“标量限制”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"标量限制"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $f \\colon R \\to S$ 为环同态. 对于左 $S$-模 $M$, 通过 $f$ 可将其视为左 $R$-模, 这给出了标量限制\n$$\r\nf^* \\colon S\\mathsf {Mod} \\to R\\mathsf {Mod}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>标量限制也可定义为\n$$\r\nf^*M := \\operatorname{Hom}_S(S,M),\r\n$$\n其中 $S$ 是左 $S$ 右 $R$ 模, $\\operatorname{Hom}_S(S,M)$ 为左 $R$-模.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>标量限制是"},{"Local":{"url":"标量扩张","text":"标量扩张"}},{"Plain":"的右伴随 ("},{"Local":{"url":"张量-同态伴随","text":"张量-同态伴随"}},{"Plain":").</p>\n<p>考虑 $f\\colon R\\to S$ 对应的"},{"Local":{"url":"仿射概形","text":"仿射概形"}},{"Plain":"的映射 $\\varphi\\colon \\operatorname{Spec}S\\to\\operatorname{Spec}R$, 则标量限制对应于"},{"Local":{"url":"六函子","text":"六函子"}},{"Plain":"中的"},{"Local":{"url":"直像","text":"直像"}},{"Plain":" $\\varphi_*\\colon \\operatorname{QCoh}(\\operatorname{Spec}S) \\to \\operatorname{QCoh}(\\operatorname{Spec}R)$.</p>\n"}]}}